As of 2026-08-26 the code lives here directly as first-class surogate
source (the former vendor and sub-project layouts are dropped): engine
modules sit under csrc/src/serve/<module>, the public API under
csrc/src/serve/api, executables under cli/ and server/, C++ tests and
benches under csrc/src/testing/serve, and the Python conversion/parity
tooling under surogate/serve/tools. Targets are defined by the main
csrc/CMakeLists.txt. Source files retain their NInfer lineage and the
divergence history is documented in PATCHES.md, which continues as the
serve engineering log.

Third-party code under third_party/ (each with its own license):
  cpp-httplib (MIT), nlohmann/json (MIT), utf8proc (MIT-style).
The NVFP4 GEMM instantiation recipe follows flashinfer
(Apache-2.0) and builds against cutlass (BSD-3-Clause) headers.
